VeSync is a portfolio company with brands that cover different categories of health &amp; wellness products. We wouldn&rsquo;t be surprised if you have one of our Levoit air purifiers in your living room or a COSORI air fryer whipping up healthy and delicious meals for you every night.

&nbsp;

We&rsquo;re a young and energetic company, we&rsquo;ve had tremendous success, and we are constantly growing our team. As we garner more industry attention - just check out our accomplishments and awards by CES Innovation, iF Design, IGA, and Red Dot - we also need driven and talented people to join our team.

&nbsp;

That brings us to you, and what you&rsquo;ll be joining. Our teams are smart and diligent and take ownership of their work - they&rsquo;re confident in their work but know how to collaborate with open ears and a spirit of learning. If you&rsquo;re down-to-earth, approachable, and easy to strike up a conversation with, this may be a great fit for you.

&nbsp;

