The Opportunity:

&nbsp;

As a Senior Visual Designer, you will lead the design and optimization of high-impact digital experiences and marketing assets that drive measurable results. You will take a lead role in designing websites, landing pages, mobile apps, emails, and digital ads, ensuring every deliverable is elevated by sophisticated design and aligned with established brand standards.

&nbsp;

This role requires an expert-level command of design fundamentals and a deep understanding of how visual hierarchy impacts user experience and conversion. Beyond execution, you will act as a design lead on key projects, collaborating cross-functionally with marketing and product teams to translate business goals into compelling visual solutions while maintaining the integrity of our design systems.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;


What you will do at VeSync:


- High-Impact Design Execution: Lead the design and optimization of websites, landing pages, mobile experiences, and digital ads, ensuring a high bar for both visual craft and performance.

- Design System Stewardship: Maintain and expand existing design systems, including style guides, UI kits, and typography standards, to ensure brand consistency across all digital platforms.

- Prototyping &amp; Collaboration: Develop responsive, high-fidelity prototypes in Figma to clearly communicate complex interactions to stakeholders and developers.

- Cross-Functional Partnership: Work closely with marketing and product teams to translate campaign objectives into effective, visually compelling creative assets.

- Performance Optimization: Use data from A/B testing and user analytics to proactively refine designs, focusing on improving engagement and conversion rates.

- Design Quality Control: Ensure all outputs are user-friendly, technically sound, and aligned with the strategic goals of the marketing team.

- Trend Integration

